#3101
The Bell Tower Stair~
   The drowned stair comes up out of the flood into the ground floor of
a bell tower, and the water runs back down the steps behind you.  The
walls here are wept green with slime, and the tower's great bell hangs
below, half-sunk in the flooded nave.~
