#3104
The Chapel of the Sunken Choir~
   The choir stalls have rotted to a lattice of black wood, and the
hymn boards on the wall still carry their lines of notes, legible
under a skin of green slime.  The water here is shallower, and
something has been singing, very recently, in the dark above it.~
