#3106
The Crossing of Green Water~
   The nave, transept and cloister meet here under a crossing tower
whose ceiling is lost in darkness.  The water moves in a slow circle,
turning the flood-weed on the flagstones with it.  Arches lead off in
every direction, and a garth of drowned garden lies north.~
