The Refectory of the Brothers~
   Long tables run the length of the hall under a ceiling of black
beams, and the benches are still drawn up to them.  The Prioress's
seat at the head has been kept clear of weed by hands that come here
regularly.  A stair down to the cellars stands open at the west end.~
