The Drowned Library~
   The library is flooded to the knee, and the shelves have been
salvaged in order:  the highest shelves are dry and orderly, the
lowest are a pulp of black paper.  Reading desks stand in rows in the
water, their books weighted open at pages no one has read in years.~
