#3113
The Scriptorium~
   Forty writing carrels stand in the scriptorium, each with its stool,
its lamp bracket and its abacus.  Ink has dried in the wells for the
last time, and the vellum on the desks is ruled but empty.  The water
has come in under the door and gone out again many times.~
